+  // instance for a relink instead of building a fresh one from scratch --
+  // only ever attempted by scalino's `--long-running` LinkDriver, the one
+  // caller (Link.scala's `previousReach`) that keeps a Reach instance alive
+  // across builds at all.
+  //
